# OpenSnitch eBPF modules configuration template
# This package installs/configures the kernel eBPF modules required by OpenSnitch.
# As a low-level kernel module component, it does not generate a text-based configuration
# file with network bindings or credentials.
# It relies on the kernel's eBPF subsystem and the OpenSnitch daemon for policy enforcement.

# No configuration directives are emitted for eBPF modules themselves.
# Management is handled via the OpenSnitch daemon and systemd units.

